y of human synovial sarcoma-associated chimeric protein SYT-SSX1 bound to chromatin remodeling factor hBRM/hSNF2<italic>&#x003b1;</italic></article-title><source><italic>Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States of America</italic></source><year>2001</year><volume>98</volume><issue>7</issue><fpage>3843</fpage><lpage>3848</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11274403</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><collab>Sarcoma Meta-Analysis Collaboration</collab><article-title>Adjuvant chemotherapy for localised resectable soft-tissue sarcoma of adults: meta-analysis of individual data</article-title><source><italic>The Lancet</italic></source><year>1997</year><volume>350</volume><issue>9092</issue><fpage>1647</fpage><lpage>1654</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>O'Byrne</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Steward</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The role of chemotherapy in the treatment of adult soft tissue sarcomas</article-title><source><italic>Oncology</italic></source><year>1999</year><volume>56</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>13</fpage><lpage>23</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9885372</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sato</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Nabeta</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsukahara</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Detection and induction of CTLs specific for SYT-SSX-derived peptides in HLA-A24<sup>+</sup> patients with synovial sarcoma</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Immunology</italic></source><year>2002</year><volume>169</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>1611</fpage><lpage>1618</lp